This is an unofficial fan-made DSH interface skin.

Mari Makinami Illustrious and Evangelion are properties of their respective
rights holders. The original character composition in
assets/mari-character-cutout.* was created with OpenAI Image generation for
this theme; it does not reuse animation frames or third-party illustrations.

The DSH skin integration follows the public client-plugin and skin-manager
contracts used by dsh-web-ui and dsh-skin-switch.
